  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "工具即子 Agent",
      "items": [
        "StaticSubAgentRegistry 把每个 SubAgentDefinition 暴露成工具：默认 toolName=subagent_<名>，参数 {task*, context}（StaticSubAgentRegistry.java:156-191）",
        "SubAgentToolExecutor 按 supports(toolName) 分流；普通调用转给配置的主执行器（SubAgentToolExecutor.java:67-101）"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "violet",
      "title": "HandoffPolicy 闸门",
      "items": [
        "maxDepth(默认1)/allowedTools/deniedTools/inputFilter 先检后行；onDenied/onError 默认 FAIL，可配 FALLBACK 回退主执行器（HandoffPolicy.java:19-49）",
        "maxRetries+timeoutMillis 控制重试与超时；每次 handoff 发 HANDOFF_START/END 事件（SubAgentToolExecutor.java:110-152）"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "amber",
      "title": "会话边界",
      "items": [
        "SubAgentSessionMode：NEW_SESSION 每次新建；REUSE_SESSION 按 toolName 复用同一会话（StaticSubAgentRegistry.java:131-163）",
        "子 Agent 同步阻塞返回 output；会话不共享——这是内部工具委托，不是 A2A 外部协议"
      ]
    }
  ]
